# The options graph of the product of fixtures/variants.ttl: the group "return", its default option "cord" (the base
# items it is made of) and the option "spring" (its parts, interfaces and lines). Under "spring" the UK spring takes the
# frame's return eye (IF-11, the frame's own feature, 0.3937 in against 10 mm), the DE anchor block the frame's spring
# anchor bore (IF-12, 8 mm against 10 mm: fastener), and the spring the pedal's heel eye turned a quarter turn (IF-13);
# the pedal's toe eye is not modelled under "spring". The two springs stand 10 in apart, the second turned a half turn.

